# Recorded/exported audio and CSV output (e.g. AudioRecord's default
# "output.wav", Scope CSV exports) -- these are simulation run artifacts,
# not source. Diagram files are also .json but live under examples/ and
# user_library/, which are explicitly force-added there; this pattern is
# about accidental recordings dropped at the repo root or wherever the app
# happens to run from.
output.wav
*.csv
